--------------------------------------------------------------------------

prebuilt/kernel and prebuilt/dt.img are binary firmware components (the
Linux kernel image and Samsung device-tree blob) extracted directly from the
RECOVERY partition of a physical, personally-owned Samsung SM-T395, for the
purpose of building a compatible custom recovery for that same device. They
are Samsung/vendor binaries, not original work under this repository's
Apache 2.0 license, and are included here only because no public, buildable
downstream kernel source exists for this device. No warranty of any kind is
made about their fitness for any purpose; use at your own risk on hardware
you own.
